DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       This  program  is largely obsoleted by the more general ppaammffuunncc(1) (use
       the --mmuullttiipplliieerr option).  ppppmmddiimm remains for backward compatibility and
       also because its use of integer arithmetic may make it faster.

       ppppmmddiimm  reads  a  PPM  image input and diminishes its brightness by the
       specified dimfactor.  The dimfactor may be in the range from 0.0 (total
       blackness,  deep night, nada, null, nothing) to 1.0 (original picture's
       brightness).


